mtt-fix-qsrreplay
Target Var(riscv_tt_fix_qsr_replay) Init(-1)
Emit code to address the Quasar replay erratum.

mtt-fix-whfence
Target Var(riscv_tt_fix_wh_fence) Init(-1)
Emit code to address Wormhole's inoperative fence instruction.

mtt-fix-whbhebreak
Target Var(riscv_tt_fix_whbh_ebreak) Init(-1)
Emit code to address the Wormhole/Blackhole ebreak erratum.

mtt-fix-whraw
Target Var(riscv_tt_fix_wh_raw) Init(-1)
Emit code to address the Wormhole read-after-write hazard.

mtt-optimize-extend
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_extend) Init(-1)
Remove extraneous zero- and sign-extension operations.

; Retired option retained so stale build flags produce a clear error.
mtt-optimize-hll
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_opt_hll) Init(-1)
Removed; using this option is an error.

mtt-tensix-optimize-cc
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_cc) Init(1)
Optimize Tensix lane condition-code (CC) state handling.

mtt-tensix-optimize-combine
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_opt_combine) Init(-1)
Removed; using this option is an error.

mtt-tensix-optimize-dce
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_dce) Init(1)
Remove dead Tensix instructions.

mtt-tensix-optimize-pressure-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_pressure_schedule) Init(0)
Schedule straight-line SFPU regions to reduce vector register pressure.

mtt-tensix-optimize-pressure-schedule-prera
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_pressure_schedule_prera) Init(0)
Run pressure-cost list scheduling on straight-line SFPU regions before register allocation.

mtt-tensix-optimize-latency-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_latency_schedule) Init(0)
Fill Tensix result-latency bubbles with independent ready SFPU instructions.

mtt-tensix-optimize-interlock-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_interlock_schedule) Init(0)
Fill known hardware-interlock stalls with independent SFPU instructions.

mtt-tensix-optimize-list-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_list_schedule) Init(0)
List-schedule straight-line SFPU regions against the modeled issue timeline.

mtt-tensix-optimize-cyclic-region-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_cyclic_region_schedule) Init(0)
Reschedule the interior regions of single-block SFPU loops to reduce the modeled steady-state initiation interval.

mtt-tensix-optimize-ims
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_ims) Init(0)
Schedule single-block SFPU loops by iterative modulo scheduling.

mtt-tensix-ims-budget=
Target Joined RejectNegative UInteger Var(riscv_tt_ims_budget) Init(0)
Set the placement budget for the modulo-scheduling eviction loop (0 = the engine default).

mtt-tensix-optimize-capture-rotation
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_capture_rotation) Init(0)
Rotate replayed capture rows to fill known interlock stalls across the row boundary.

mtt-tensix-optimize-drain-schedule
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_drain_schedule) Init(0)
Elide provably unnecessary drain NOPs at macro run boundaries.

mtt-tensix-optimize-window-pairing
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_window_pairing) Init(0)
Reduce inter-row drain spacing to the minimum the pending-event model proves safe.

mtt-tensix-optimize-window-pairing-stride
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_window_pairing_stride) Init(0)
Extend window-pairing proofs to rows whose addresses advance with any issued word of the row.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossrow-pairing
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossrow_pairing) Init(0)
Pair consecutive iterations of eligible single-row Dst loops into one doubled row (Blackhole only).

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossrow-pairing-stall-words
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossrow_pairing_stall_words) Init(0)
Admit next-slot-stall instructions into cross-row pairing, priced at two issue slots (Blackhole only).

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossrow-pairing-seed
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossrow_pairing_seed) Init(0)
Allow cross-row pairing to seed all-lanes copies so predicated value webs can be renamed (Blackhole only).

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossrow-shared-reload
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossrow_shared_reload) Init(0)
Share identical constant materializations between the two halves of a paired row (Blackhole only).

mtt-tensix-optimize-mve-expand
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_mve_expand) Init(0)
Realize the modulo-variable-expansion kernel unroll on eligible paired SFPU loops (Blackhole only).

; Internal red/green test knob: deliberately breaks one rename so the
; post-commit verification is seen to catch it; never a tuning knob.
mtt-tensix-mve-expand-sabotage
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_mve_expand_sabotage) Init(0)
Testing only: mis-rotate one committed modulo-variable-expansion rename to exercise the post-commit verification.

mtt-tensix-optimize-init-hoist
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_init_hoist) Init(0)
Hoist a callee's loop-invariant initialization prefix into the calling loop's preheader.

mtt-tensix-optimize-prgm-const
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_prgm_const) Init(0)
Allocate programmable constant registers to loop-invariant SFPU immediates.

mtt-tensix-optimize-const-residency
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_const_residency) Init(0)
Allocate programmable constant registers to proven-constant SFPU values by priced selection.

mtt-tensix-optimize-const-remat
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_const_remat) Init(0)
Rematerialize proven-constant SFPU values at their uses when vector register pressure exceeds the register file.

mtt-tensix-optimize-pressure-park
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_pressure_park) Init(0)
Hoist qualifying constant materializations placed after a CC write when a whole-function pressure model proves it safe.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossloop-cc-peel
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossloop_cc_peel) Init(0)
Program parked constants once at the outermost proven loop entry instead of once per enclosing-loop iteration.

mtt-tensix-optimize-opaque-replay-record
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_opaque_replay_record) Init(0)
Analyze raw replay record regions for the constant-register freedom proof instead of treating the whole translation unit as opaque.

mtt-tensix-optimize-hoisted-prgm-reuse
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_hoisted_prgm_reuse) Init(0)
Let invariant constants already hoisted out of a loop claim programmable constant registers.

mtt-tensix-optimize-loop-prgm-reclaim
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_loop_prgm_reclaim) Init(0)
Reprogram provably unread programmable constant registers with new values at loop entry.

mtt-tensix-optimize-madpair-vocabulary
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_madpair_vocabulary) Init(0)
Recognize additional multiply-add operand spellings when collecting constant-residency candidates.

mtt-tensix-optimize-park-ordering
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_park_ordering) Init(0)
Defer qualifying in-loop constant placements from the early invariant hoist to the late constant-residency walk.

mtt-tensix-optimize-residency-merge-rename
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_residency_merge_rename) Init(0)
Rename in-loop constant CC merges so the constant can be parked outside the loop.

; Internal measurement override: admits renames the priced verdict
; refuses so a floor certificate can be re-measured on hardware.
mtt-tensix-merge-rename-allow-neutral
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_merge_rename_allow_neutral) Init(0)
Measurement only: admit delivery-word-neutral merge renames that the priced verdict refuses.

mtt-tensix-optimize-priced-placement
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_priced_placement) Init(0)
Arbitrate the competing invariant-constant placement tiers through one priced authority.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-alloc
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lreg_alloc) Init(0)
Color the SFPU vector interference graph before register allocation, spilling selected value webs through free Dst scratch rows.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-coalesce
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lreg_coalesce) Init(0)
Apply conservative (Briggs/George) coalescing to the SFPU vector interference graph.

mtt-tensix-dst-layout-32b
Target Var(riscv_tt_dst_layout_32b) Init(0)
Declare that every SFPU calculation body in this translation unit executes under a 32-bit-row Dst layout; a false declaration causes silent wrong output.

mtt-tensix-optimize-transp-involution
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_transp_involution) Init(0)
Fuse an SFPTRANSP with the full-bank loads defining its operands into one companion-preserving bundle.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crosslane
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crosslane) Init(0)
Optimize recognized cross-lane instruction sequences through their proven permutation algebra.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay-exec-record
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay_exec_record) Init(0)
Execute a hoisted Tensix replay capture while recording and drop the first now-redundant playback launch.

mtt-tensix-optimize-dst-iteration-fusion
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_dst_iteration_fusion) Init(0)
Recognize and fuse legal adjacent Tensix Dst-register iterations.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lp-schedule
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_opt_lp_schedule) Init(-1)
Removed; using this option is an error.

mtt-tensix-pressure-schedule-use-milp
Target Var(riscv_tt_pressure_schedule_use_milp) Init(0)
Use the exact branch-and-bound solver when the pressure-scheduling list heuristic cannot satisfy capacity.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay) Init(1)
Generate Tensix replay instructions.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay-hoist
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay_hoist) Init(0)
Hoist fixed-encoding Tensix replay captures out of profitable loops.

mtt-tensix-replay-hoist-completion-guard
Target Var(riscv_tt_replay_hoist_completion_guard) Init(0)
Use a drain-inclusive completion contract when pricing hoisted Tensix replay records.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay-record-hoist
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay_record_hoist) Init(0)
Hoist the record phase of an iteration-invariant re-recorded replay capture to the loop's preheader.

mtt-tensix-optimize-record-hoist-peel
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_record_hoist_peel) Init(0)
Hoist a Dst-storing replay capture by peeling the loop's first iteration into the preheader.

mtt-tensix-optimize-record-hoist-lift
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_record_hoist_lift) Init(0)
Move a hoisted replay record outward across enclosing loops to the outermost provably safe preheader.

mtt-tensix-optimize-counted-capture-peel
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_counted_capture_peel) Init(0)
Extend the first-iteration peel to counted-loop replay captures whose plain hoist is unprofitable.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay-window-sizing
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay_window_sizing) Init(0)
Prefer wider replay windows when the capture is hoisted and the per-iteration cost is launches alone.

; Internal measurement knob: reporting-only shadow of the window
; discovery; it never changes which windows are formed.
mtt-tensix-replay-shadow-discovery
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_replay_shadow_discovery) Init(0)
Measurement only: run the suffix-automaton window discovery as a reporting shadow beside the standard discovery.

mtt-tensix-optimize-counted-row-formation
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_counted_row) Init(0)
Canonicalize parameterized repeated SFPU rows so replay formation can record one parameterized row program.

mtt-tensix-optimize-replay-loop-unroll
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_replay_loop_unroll) Init(0)
Request generic unrolling of counted single-block SFPU row loops so replay formation can capture the repeated row.

mtt-tensix-optimize-launch-flatten
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_launch_flatten) Init(0)
Request complete unrolling of counted innermost delivery loops so the flattened word stream reaches replay formation.

mtt-tensix-optimize-delivery-shape
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_delivery_shape) Init(0)
Choose each counted SFPU row loop's unroll factor and delivery tier by exact optimization over the issue-cost model.

mtt-tensix-delivery-shape-min-benefit=
Target Joined RejectNegative UInteger Var(riscv_tt_delivery_shape_min_benefit) Init(-1)
Set the minimum modeled benefit, in hundredths of an issue slot per loop entry, required for a non-rolled delivery shape.

mtt-tensix-optimize-round-interleave
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_round_interleave) Init(0)
Interleave two iterations of counted SFPU round loops whose iterations are provably independent.

mtt-tensix-replay-hoist-min-benefit=
Target Joined RejectNegative UInteger Var(riscv_tt_replay_hoist_min_benefit) Init(-1)
Set the minimum modeled benefit, in hundredths of an issue slot, required to hoist a replay capture.

; Internal diagnostic-test knob: manufactures a trip-oracle-divergence
; diagnostic; the deciding oracle and generated code are unchanged.
mtt-tensix-trips-oracle-skew=
Target Undocumented Joined RejectNegative UInteger Var(riscv_tt_trips_oracle_skew) Init(0) IntegerRange(0,65535)
Testing only: skew the classical trip-count verdict to manufacture a trip-oracle-divergence diagnostic.

mtt-tensix-optimize-mop-form
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_mop_form) Init(0)
Re-roll runs and counted loops of identical Tensix replay playback launches into a hardware MOP loop.

mtt-tensix-mop-form-min-benefit=
Target Joined RejectNegative UInteger Var(riscv_tt_mop_form_min_benefit) Init(-1)
Set the minimum modeled benefit, in hundredths of an issue slot, required to form a MOP loop.

; Internal measurement override: bypasses only the profitability verdict
; so hardware A/B comparisons of refused shapes can be built.
mtt-tensix-mop-form-force
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_mop_form_force) Init(0)
Measurement only: bypass the MOP formation profitability refusal; every structural and soundness proof still applies.

mtt-tensix-optimize-invariant-loadi
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_invariant_loadi) Init(0)
Hoist loop-invariant Tensix immediate-vector materializations before register allocation.

mtt-tensix-optimize-dst-autoincr
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_dst_autoincr) Init(0)
Replace constant-stride per-row Dst counter increments with owned address-modifier auto-increment.

mtt-tensix-optimize-dst-autoincr-load-carrier
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_dst_autoincr_load_carrier) Init(0)
Count audited raw single-constant instruction words as replay-slot-occupying so load-carrier rows can form.

mtt-tensix-optimize-post-autoincr-window
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_post_autoincr_window) Init(0)
Defer replay window formation until after Dst auto-increment folding so word-uniform bodies can be captured.

; Internal measurement override: alternate candidate-selection key for
; building hardware A/B comparisons; soundness proofs unchanged.
mtt-tensix-post-autoincr-window-prefer-longest
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_post_autoincr_window_prefer_longest) Init(0)
Measurement only: select post-auto-increment window candidates by maximal payload length first.

mtt-tensix-optimize-dst-ownership
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_dst_ownership) Init(1)
Fold proven-identity Dst reloads into register-resident values using the Dst ownership analysis.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lut-select
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lut_select) Init(1)
Select Tensix SFPU LUT instructions from encodable magnitude range-dispatch trees.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lut-select-leaf-ext
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lut_select_leaf_ext) Init(0)
Extend LUT instruction selection with certified multiply-only and provable-constant leaf classes.

mtt-tensix-optimize-lut-select-fp16
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lut_select_fp16) Init(0)
Extend LUT instruction selection with the FP16-coefficient six-entry SFPLUTFP32 table modes.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crosscall-hoist
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crosscall_hoist) Init(0)
Hoist a callee's call-invariant pinned-register immediate materializations into proven callers' loop preheaders.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crosscall-config-prefix
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crosscall_config_prefix) Init(0)
Extend the cross-call hoist to a callee's constant SFPCONFIG programming prefix.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crosscall-addrmod
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crosscall_addrmod) Init(0)
Hoist a callee's owned address-modifier configuration program into proven callers' loop entries.

mtt-tensix-optimize-crossloop-hoist
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_crossloop_hoist) Init(0)
Hoist loop-invariant SFPU immediate materializations across enclosing loops proven free of interfering effects.

mtt-tensix-optimize-repr-prop
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_repr_prop) Init(0)
Cancel proven-involution SFPU representation-conversion pairs across value webs.

mtt-tensix-optimize-reassoc
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_reassoc) Init(0)
Allow value-changing floating-point reassociation in the Tensix SFPU passes; requires -fassociative-math to take effect.

mtt-tensix-optimize-reassoc-loop-carried
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_reassoc_loop_carried) Init(0)
Allow splitting loop-carried floating-point accumulations into parallel partial sums; requires -fassociative-math to take effect.

mtt-tensix-optimize-reassoc-mad-restructure
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_reassoc_mad_restructure) Init(0)
Allow fusing separate multiply and add instructions into one fused multiply-add; requires -fassociative-math to take effect.

; Historical spelling: requests the same renaming engine as
; -mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-rename-chains.
mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-rename
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lreg_rename) Init(0)
Rename storage-colliding vector register webs (historical spelling of -mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-rename-chains).

mtt-tensix-optimize-lreg-rename-chains
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_lreg_rename_chains) Init(0)
Rename storage-colliding vector register def-use webs onto proven-free registers after allocation.

mtt-tensix-optimize-rename-temporal
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_rename_temporal) Init(0)
Admit temporally-scoped rename targets and cyclic-interior rename requests in the vector register renaming engine.

mtt-tensix-optimize-rename-cc-region
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_rename_cc_region) Init(0)
Admit renames across proven-balanced CC regions in the vector register renaming engine.

mtt-tensix-optimize-ccmask
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_ccmask) Init(0)
Fold a single-zero-assign predicated SFPU region into a value-mask compare and AND.

mtt-tensix-optimize-cc-region-general
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_cc_region_general) Init(0)
Accept any statement layout the shared CC-region frame tree proves equivalent to the historically recognized shapes.

mtt-tensix-optimize-native-compare
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_native_compare) Init(0)
Lower eligible float vector comparison webs to the native Blackhole SFPGT/SFPLE instructions.

mtt-tensix-optimize-int-abs
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_int_abs) Init(0)
Fold a conditional-negate predicated SFPU region into the single integer SFPABS instruction.

mtt-tensix-optimize-int-not
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_int_not) Init(0)
Select the single SFPNOT instruction for the all-ones-minus-x one's-complement pattern.

mtt-tensix-optimize-store-fold
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_store_fold) Init(0)
Fold lane-predicated SFPU value merges into their consuming Dst stores where the round trip is proven the identity.

mtt-tensix-optimize-store-sink
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_store_sink) Init(0)
Allow sinking an all-lanes store of a predicated merge into its region as a predicated store; changes stored values on denormal pass-through lanes.

mtt-tensix-optimize-stochrnd-store-fold
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_stochrnd_store_fold) Init(0)
Allow folding an explicit nearest-rounding precision reduction into its consuming converting store; changes delivered bits on the proven divergence classes.

mtt-tensix-optimize-store-source-tier
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_store_source_tier) Init(0)
Keep store-consumed constants in ordinary vector registers instead of programmable constant registers.

mtt-tensix-optimize-setexp-fold
Target Var(riscv_tt_opt_setexp_fold) Init(1)
Fold a biased Tensix SFPU exponent extract feeding SFPSETEXP into the exponent-copy addressing mode.

; Retired option retained so stale build flags produce a clear error.
mtt-tensix-analyze-loadmacro
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_analyze_loadmacro) Init(0)
Removed; using this option is an error.

; Retired option retained so stale build flags produce a clear error.
mtt-tensix-emit-loadmacro
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_emit_loadmacro) Init(0)
Removed; using this option is an error.

mtt-tensix-macro-planner
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner) Init(0)
Plan, prove, and materialize SFPLOADMACRO schedules from typed effects and target capability tables.

mtt-tensix-macro-planner-analyze
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner_analyze) Init(0)
Report macro-planner regions and their recorded decline reasons without changing code.

mtt-tensix-macro-planner-verify
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner_verify) Init(0)
Differentially verify synthesized macro-planner descriptors against the region's explicit facts.

; Internal red/green test knob: corrupts only the verifier-local copy,
; pinning that a verification mismatch refuses formation.
mtt-tensix-macro-planner-verify-corrupt-template
Target Undocumented Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner_verify_corrupt_template) Init(0)
Testing only: corrupt the verifier's local copy of one template word to check that a mismatch refuses formation.

mtt-tensix-macro-planner-replay
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner_replay) Init(0)
Admit planner-formed SFPLOADMACRO launches into automatic replay recording.

mtt-tensix-macro-planner-residency
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_planner_residency) Init(0)
Extend proven macro descriptor programming outward across enclosing loops and share identical descriptor programs.

mtt-tensix-macro-ims
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_ims) Init(0)
Retry refused macro-calendar proposals with reduced hosted sets and arbitrate formation against the replay alternative.

mtt-tensix-macro-ims-carrier
Target Var(riscv_tt_macro_ims_carrier) Init(0)
Form extra-value-carrier variants of proven macro calendars, committing only variants that re-prove at a smaller initiation interval.

mtt-tensix-dump-effects
Target Var(riscv_tt_dump_effects) Init(0)
Annotate assembler output with each instruction's modeled Tensix architectural effect set.

mtt-tensix-replay-buffer-size=
Target Joined RejectNegative Var(riscv_tt_replay_size) UInteger Init(32) IntegerRange(1,32)
Set the length of the replay buffer available for replay optimization.

